#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:5 93e79f53fb0e42b3b586310e9169a7e8
msgid "Arming the motors"
msgstr "解锁电机"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:7 3e0479f3f3e14dafaff8c5d36669a09f
msgid ""
"Arming the vehicle allows the motors to start spinning.  Before arming, make"
" sure all people, objects, and any body parts (e.g., hands) are clear of the"
" propellers. Then do the following:"
msgstr "解锁飞行器可使电机开始旋转。解锁前，请确保所有人员、物品和身体部位（如手）远离螺旋桨。然后执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:12 2e4d3358fe574fc5bbd258caa6221fb2
msgid "Turn on your transmitter."
msgstr "打开遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:13 bfbf4d7ca05340d8b19c9227fdbde472
msgid ""
"Plug in the LiPo battery.  The red and blue lights should flash for a few "
"seconds as the gyros are calibrated (do not move the copter)"
msgstr "插上LiPo电池。红灯和蓝灯应闪烁几秒以完成陀螺仪校准（此时请勿移动飞行器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:14 dfb7c8c0afea4916a915390d23e43cc6
msgid ""
"The pre-arm checks will run automatically and if any problems are found the "
"RGB LED will blink yellow and the failure will be displayed on the ground "
"station.  Please refer to :ref:`this page <common-prearm-safety-checks>`"
msgstr ""
"解锁前检查将自动运行，如果发现任何问题，RGB LED将闪烁黄色，故障信息将显示在地面站上。请参考 :ref:`此页面 <common-prearm-"
"safety-checks>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:57 2d57d9aaa47442009257d7b9934a6186
#: af86ba00ae3e4c67a7a1903a1dcf83a5
msgid ""
"Check that your flight mode switch is set to Stabilize, ACRO, AltHold, "
"Loiter, or PosHold"
msgstr "检查飞行模式开关是否设置为Stabilize、Acro、AltHold、Loiter或PosHold。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:16 77299d800f6644b49260e70c25c001b7
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a safety switch, press it until the light goes "
"solid"
msgstr "如果使用带安全开关的飞控，按压安全开关直到指示灯变为常亮。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:17 73be4c84736a4a12843b7078477b3e8f
msgid ""
"If you are planning on using an autonomous mode (i.e. Loiter, RTL, Auto, "
"etc) switch the vehicle to Loiter or PosHold and wait until the LEDs blink "
"green indicating a good GPS lock"
msgstr ""
"如果您计划使用自主模式（如Loiter、RTL、Auto等），将飞行器切换到Loiter或PosHold并等待LED闪绿灯，表示GPS锁定良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:18 f0480c68c6d54d9785f28f510b2ec928
msgid ""
"Arm the motors by holding the throttle down, and rudder right for 5 seconds."
"  Do not hold the rudder right for too long (>15 seconds) or you will begin "
"the :ref:`AutoTrim <autotrim>` feature"
msgstr ""
"通过将油门摇杆向下、方向舵向右保持5秒来解锁电机。不要将方向舵向右保持太长时间（>15秒），否则将启动 :ref:`AutoTrim "
"<autotrim>` 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:19 61a6e893ed614afca739a2af30755848
msgid ""
"Once armed, the LEDs will go solid and the propellers will begin to spin"
msgstr "解锁后，LED将变为常亮，螺旋桨将开始旋转。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:20 8a36af7cea75481494d0d479153e3b29
msgid "Raise the throttle to take-off"
msgstr "推高油门起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:24 478de14fb5d543afb78c7705fa5f6cfd
msgid ""
"If you leave the throttle at minimum for 15 seconds while in any of the "
"above modes the motors will automatically disarm."
msgstr "如果在上述任何模式下将油门保持在最低位置15秒，电机将自动上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:27 340ebf3019d54b8dbfa65ae15be88b98
msgid "you cannot arm while in certain modes. See the table below:"
msgstr "在某些模式下无法解锁。请参见下表："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:30 21a6a9d9a0b54e069eb9301e20f50709
msgid "Modes not allowing Arming"
msgstr "不允许解锁的模式"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:30 9f31f02c23d74b5b80397ee776a51d5e
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "例外情况"

