#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:48 e6977f2fd4fb44a9a51effce57d6e74e
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the **RC_xOPTION switches** that includes the "
"arm function. See switch option \"153\", \"154, or \"160\"."
msgstr "如果已设置，可以使用包含解锁功能的 **RC_xOPTION开关** 之一。参见开关选项\"153\"、\"154\"或\"160\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:50 ffbf9c84baab4442ba792072434e70bb
msgid ""
"Copter will allow arming in some modes without a good GPS location being "
"obtained before arming. If you want any of the modes such as RTL, LOITER, "
"etc. to work properly, you should enable the \"Need location\" pre-arm check"
" by setting the :ref:`ARMING_NEED_LOC<ARMING_NEED_LOC>` parameter to \"1\" "
"to be sure you have position information available."
msgstr ""
"Copter 在某些模式下允许在解锁前尚未获得良好 GPS 位置的情况下解锁。如果希望 RTL、LOITER 等模式正常工作，应将 "
":ref:`ARMING_NEED_LOC<ARMING_NEED_LOC>` 参数设为 \"1\" 以启用 \"Need location\" "
"解锁前检查，确保位置信息可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:53 78be7251a1124b1fb95e28dd83a999ae
msgid "Disarming the motors"
msgstr "上锁电机"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:55 b6b34c2b1f484b2c8baa3ad7a5f5f8d3
msgid ""
"Disarming the motors will cause the motors to stop spinning. To disarm the "
"motors do the following:"
msgstr "上锁电机将使电机停止旋转。要上锁电机，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:58 de04b01b102046079fe59a426850238f
msgid "Hold throttle at minimum and rudder to the left for 2 seconds"
msgstr "将油门保持在最低，方向舵向左保持2秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:59 1ed1e79e1d8f43d997364a65d5b52156
msgid "The LED will start flashing indicating the vehicle is disarmed"
msgstr "LED将开始闪烁，表示飞行器已上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:60 29024e80d63443f18d876ef58d28e285
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a safety switch, press it until the LED begins "
"flashing"
msgstr "如果使用带安全开关的飞控，按压安全开关直到LED开始闪烁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:61 5e73901d8eba41c6aee65c8051ad9a70
msgid "Disconnect the Lipo battery."
msgstr "断开LiPo电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:62 a2fa2fb68a9147f59e2462c730ce00d7
msgid "Turn off your transmitter."
msgstr "关闭遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:64 850627229874473ab60f1183700a71e9
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the ``RC_xOPTION`` switches that includes the "
"disarm function. See switch option \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "如果已设置，可以使用包含上锁功能的 ``RC_xOPTION`` 开关之一。参见开关选项\"81\"、\"153\"或\"154\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:67 a953ae1c2c1345058a29ef0af109bb40
msgid "GCS Status Messages"
msgstr "地面站状态消息"

#: ../../source/docs/arming_the_motors.rst:69 50d9c73f366a41eea46d4c3f3da478c1
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text messages"
" will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 2 "
"位，否则在解锁或上锁时将向地面站发送文本消息以进行指示。"
